{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach, pick up, and use subtree to process. If not, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
